  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《我興ê早頓》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">張寶明</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhbu6qRMe2HQtVIBCzRKeVz15q1-smcSFTZPhHGDV9VdaLLQ08Mxyuoaxh48F7q82XybYO7ULNcX4MjKCTV4-l0BOkCE7qoJp3ORcEnymfOwwIk3FajXYnRLvp9dOg_LnpZRWiqib4rBdWl1o20geQBWvKj6O5QIYm0n3vxTRXgXmGfYqZ8P2krNbD5iQT7\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhbu6qRMe2HQtVIBCzRKeVz15q1-smcSFTZPhHGDV9VdaLLQ08Mxyuoaxh48F7q82XybYO7ULNcX4MjKCTV4-l0BOkCE7qoJp3ORcEnymfOwwIk3FajXYnRLvp9dOg_LnpZRWiqib4rBdWl1o20geQBWvKj6O5QIYm0n3vxTRXgXmGfYqZ8P2krNbD5iQT7=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhbu6qRMe2HQtVIBCzRKeVz15q1-smcSFTZPhHGDV9VdaLLQ08Mxyuoaxh48F7q82XybYO7ULNcX4MjKCTV4-l0BOkCE7qoJp3ORcEnymfOwwIk3FajXYnRLvp9dOg_LnpZRWiqib4rBdWl1o20geQBWvKj6O5QIYm0n3vxTRXgXmGfYqZ8P2krNbD5iQT7\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjzrR7_i1p49NOqCAeuq6f9B2fy4x8wStNVPKb76Kdz2O3x68oUJtG5WNp8MRz9y45lvWYCE0UcOGoxnNo0sJ-FwnJJcWADFRzX7ZI3UxS8_Xul-L6o2tQm5gBLuklZ07P83mLbmPKAI8QhqKYNUI6kgr9lDv29yQCwnMfioxrCtnCUq98XtUP5xwCro2vt\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjzrR7_i1p49NOqCAeuq6f9B2fy4x8wStNVPKb76Kdz2O3x68oUJtG5WNp8MRz9y45lvWYCE0UcOGoxnNo0sJ-FwnJJcWADFRzX7ZI3UxS8_Xul-L6o2tQm5gBLuklZ07P83mLbmPKAI8QhqKYNUI6kgr9lDv29yQCwnMfioxrCtnCUq98XtUP5xwCro2vt=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有真濟研究講早頓真重要，無食ē影響規工ê精神。所以，無意外我逐工lóng ē食早頓，suah食kah有體會。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">自我有記憶，阮兜ê早頓是食飯配菜鹹，極ke是配一粒早起雞母生ê卵，卵仁煎半生熟ê卵包。啊khiàn蔥仔芳ê王梨豆醬仔是走bē去逐工有，所以，我kah意王梨豆醬仔煮ê料理是án-ne來--ê。阿爹仔早頓愛食飯討厭食糜，專 kah人無仝，伊講：「我規工ê khang-khuè ài出大力，無食飯kah油tsho thài有才調應付。」Tsit句話iáu刻tī我ê心肝頭。講mā怪奇，我ê囡仔lóng m̄食糜，kám是thn̂g著in阿公？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">自來到台北食頭路，過都市ê日子，就罕得早頓食我本來就慣勢食ê清糜小菜--ah。睏uànn無時間家己pìnn--無-打-緊，出入ê路頭路尾無看人leh賣，若專工走去食，食煞見ē m̄甘tiuh-tiuh，因為食一頓ê錢thìng好平常時仔食三頓，是主要ê原因。落尾tsiah知都市ê清糜小菜是好額人leh食--ê，知影了後我就無koh食--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">當然hit-tsūn來都市蹛，就真自然beh做都市人，過都市ê生活。早頓就tuè人食『美而美』tsit種西洋式--ê，見食腹肚就ná食無飽ê感覺，一直bē慣勢，就親像tsiok久tsiok久無食著飯hit款ê 礙虐。無ta-uâ，食早頓就準做是kā腹肚有一下交代。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">日子一下過久，tsit種西洋式ê早頓就bóng kā接受，無koh再去kā品評--ah。一直到hōo公司調去高雄做業務，對早頓ê理解有解體性ê改變。甚至bat kā牽--ê講：「除非無tè食其他ê早頓，無，拍死mā m̄食西洋式--ê。」Tī高雄kah做業務ê同事做伙出去走生理，三頓食外口，上無一頓ē食滷肉飯、雞肉飯kah米粉炒tsit款ê傳統食si̍t，配白菜滷、筍絲、豆腐滷iah是滷卵tsit款ê小菜，若食湯m̄是豬血湯就是肉羹，tsit味ê傳統食si̍t經過我五冬外ê業務生活，suah釘根tī我ê觀念--裡，我認為tsit味ê傳統食si̍t我上興。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">離開業務ê生活到tann，已經m̄知幾冬--ah，貧惰去算，算mā無khah-tsua̍h，ke怨嘆--ê niâ。M̄-koh，tsit味傳統百姓ê食si̍t suah tsiânn做我ê生活習慣--ah，一禮拜上無ē食兩三改，逐改ē換leh食無仝ê菜色。見食to飽足，見食to滿足。Tse tsiânn實是心靈ê感覺，tse應該就是「興」所引起--ê。</span></div></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhb7w8jfTtkob-ku37dgDHM-VKixFNjEeIp3zioXgCMQjFT8i31G6ZoOE73oGIJpO0YcPGd3u_HlSwANY0C8iIzZdjHvubxUEJ-fkWB4e9KZSEn1-AA1C0-Dy3Dusbma1QMXjy8N3zuwxcmwQvkj1E2nTtcfA2z-oHVlBlkRjuUbh5P23WUzqNlPduH71ie\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhb7w8jfTtkob-ku37dgDHM-VKixFNjEeIp3zioXgCMQjFT8i31G6ZoOE73oGIJpO0YcPGd3u_HlSwANY0C8iIzZdjHvubxUEJ-fkWB4e9KZSEn1-AA1C0-Dy3Dusbma1QMXjy8N3zuwxcmwQvkj1E2nTtcfA2z-oHVlBlkRjuUbh5P23WUzqNlPduH71ie=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /><br /></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: